I step outside my building.
I walk towards the BEST bus stop.
It is still morning.
But the sun is very harsh outside.
It is very hot today.
I walk slowly down the street.
I am sweating a lot.
I reach the bus stop.
There is a small tree there.
There is some shade under the tree.
I stand in that shade.
Other people are also standing in the shade.
The air is very humid and sticky.
Mumbai's heat is quite different.
I wait for the bus.
The weather app says, it will rain in the evening.
But I look at the sky.
The sky is completely blue.
There is not a single cloud in the sky.
After a short while, my red bus arrives.
